Your agreement

Your partnership / sponsorship agreement is supplied separately for signing. If you have not yet received it, please contact the NTE team.

Final event details will be sent approximately two weeks before the event. If you have any questions, please do feel free to get in touch.

Staff details and event preparation

When your final attendee list is ready, submit the names using the partner / sponsor staff form.

Please upload your latest company logo for {NTE_EVENT_LABEL} marketing and event materials. We request the latest artwork from every participating organisation, as branding may have changed.

{NTE_PREPARATION_LINKS}
If anything above needs correcting, reply to this email or contact nte@missioncommunity.org (mailto:nte@missioncommunity.org).

Kind regards,
The National Transition Event Team
Mission Community

{NTE_EVENT_LABEL} • The Wing, Silverstone

